---
title: "submitApplication (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: POST /v1/integration/rounds/id/submit
    q_receive --> q_auth: validate JWT token
    q_auth --> q_unauthorized: token invalid
    q_unauthorized --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_auth --> q_lookup: token valid
    q_lookup --> q_not_found: round does not exist
    q_not_found --> [*]: return 404 not found
    q_lookup --> q_check_active: round exists
    q_check_active --> q_closed: round not active
    q_closed --> [*]: return error round closed
    q_check_active --> q_check_dup: round is active
    q_check_dup --> q_already: user already applied
    q_already --> [*]: return error duplicate application
    q_check_dup --> q_submit: no prior application
    q_submit --> q_store: create application record
    q_store --> [*]: return application confirmation

    note right of q_check_active
        INV-001: applications only accepted for active rounds
        INV-002: a user may not submit duplicate applications to same round
        INV-003: application must be persisted before confirmation
    end note
